{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "04fd6f57-7bc5-8a18-ade7-7e532771cfb5",
  "created_at": "2026-01-17T10:01:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:58:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:58:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Is it all right if I ask about a plow issue? I know it's Saturday and City Hall's closed, so I wasn't sure if this line was the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:58:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, this is the right one. We keep the storm line open on weekends. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:58:28-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. So the city plow came down my street earlier and my car is plowed in. There's a wall of snow along the whole front of it. Um, sorry, my phone's in the cup holder and I have the volume low, so if I get quiet, just say so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:58:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I've got you fine. Which street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "245 Spring Street. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:58:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two forty-five Spring. Okay. And the car's parked on the street, right at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:59:00-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, at the curb in front of the house. Is it all right if I ask something else? It's not a big storm, right, it's just a dusting. But it's been so cold that everything's packed and icy. The plow pushed up a hard ridge and I can't chip through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:59:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens in a cold snap. The plow rolls through, the snow's heavy and frozen, and it just shoves it against the parked cars. So you've got a berm behind and in front, or just along the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:59:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly along the driver's side and a bit behind. The front's okay, I think. [pause] Sorry, did you say something? The volume's low."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:59:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said, along the side and behind. Got it. I'm writing that down. Two forty-five Spring, car plowed in, driver's side and rear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T09:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yes. And is it all right if I ask for sand? The sidewalk and the spot by my car are just glazed over. I'd like to get some down so I can dig out without sliding around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:00:05-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. We can send a truck to sand if the street's slick, and I'll note it on the ticket. If you just want some for your own spot, there's usually a sand pile you can grab from. Do you want the truck, or a place to pick it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:00:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, the truck would be good, if that's possible. For the street. I can't really carry a bucket anywhere, I'm without a car right now, obviously."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Okay, I'll put in a sanding request for Spring Street at that address. I can't give you a time, crews are working through the list today, but it's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Is it all right if I ask whether the plow will come back and clear the berm? Or do I just dig it out myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:00:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually the residents dig out the bit the plow leaves at their car. The crews don't come back for that. I'll flag it so the driver knows, but plan on shoveling it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:01:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Understood. I just wanted to be sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:01:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Let me read back. George, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:01:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, George Sisson. S-I-S-S-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:01:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sisson. And a callback number, in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:01:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:01:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0181. So that's 245 Spring Street, car plowed in, sanding requested. You're all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:01:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thank you. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T10:01:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, George. Stay warm."
    }
  ],
